      "role": "user",
      "content": "Got it, thanks for clarifying that. One more thing for the lesson—is there any way to mitigate that \"attack\" on the eyes during the demo? I've heard people suggest wearing goggles or something, but I want to explain if there's a way to actually slow down or neutralize that sudden \"sting\" before it hits the eyes.",
